{"id":"n14109-1-7","stage":3,"title":"영혼 · 灵魂","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14109-1-7-1","ko":"너 '파우스트'라는 책 읽어 봤니?","zh":"你读过《浮士德》这本书吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"'파우스트'라는","meaning":"《浮士德》","explanation":"파우스트：《浮士德》；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"파우스트'라는","audio":"/audio/f258ed11e59d5b4a2790.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파우스트'라는","audio":"/audio/f258ed11e59d5b4a2790.mp3"}},{"text":"책","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}},{"text":"읽어","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽어","audio":"/audio/796762554f8ccb7c2ddf.mp3"}},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤니","audio":"/audio/f1501c6cd4fb2c2f0d42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/79872d46cd27cd085e35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14109-1-7-2","ko":"응, 영혼을 악마에게 파는 이야기잖아.","zh":"嗯，就是把灵魂卖给魔鬼的故事啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"영혼을","meaning":"灵魂","explanation":"영혼：灵魂；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영혼","audio":"/audio/65f2195bf2964151ca43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14109","senseId":"1","lemma":"영혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영혼을","audio":"/audio/7b49fc13853d6149989f.mp3"}},{"text":"악마에게","meaning":"魔鬼","explanation":"악마：魔鬼；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"악마","audio":"/audio/ec41d6c0e8755719e472.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66502","senseId":"2","lemma":"악마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"악마에게","audio":"/audio/799ae5bc6ed902549540.mp3"}},{"text":"파는","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파는","audio":"/audio/25c21fc22e6f2547eb25.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기잖아.","meaning":"故事","explanation":"이야기：故事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"1","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기잖아","audio":"/audio/3c91691c6207a24dba09.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"65f2195bf2964151","term":"영혼","zh":"灵魂","audio":"/audio/65f2195bf2964151ca43.mp3","entryId":"14109","definition":"使肉体能够活动的精神实体。","pronunciation":["영혼"]},{"id":"ec41d6c0e8755719","term":"악마","zh":"魔鬼","audio":"/audio/ec41d6c0e8755719e472.mp3","entryId":"66502","definition":"在基督教中，与上帝对立而引诱人类走上罪恶道路的邪恶的存在。","pronunciation":["앙마"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"说或写给别人的关于某个事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等的话或文章。","pronunciation":["이야기"]}],"audio":"/audio/91ff06af4c92f1bccad9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14109","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.0577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，就是把灵魂卖给魔鬼的故事啊。","你读过《浮士德》这本书吗？","在这里不可以大声喧哗或闹着玩。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你读过《浮士德》这本书吗？","在这里不可以大声喧哗或闹着玩。","嗯，就是把灵魂卖给魔鬼的故事啊。"],"answer":2}]}
